    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "418",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果把装满第二个鱼缸的水全部倒入第一个鱼缸，那么",
        "第一个鱼缸的水位升到多少？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "419",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一个人每分钟吸气15次.每次吸入0.55升空气.一小",
        "时吸入的空气是多少升？它的质量是多少（一升空气的",
        "质量是1.3克）？一昼夜吸入空气的质量是多少？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "420",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "计算：",
        "1) $3\\frac{5}{7}-2\\frac{1}{7}+4\\frac{2}{7}$；3) $7\\frac{2}{9}+2\\frac{5}{9}-3\\frac{1}{9}$；",
        "2) $-\\frac{7}{9}+\\frac{5}{9}-\\frac{2}{9}$；　　4) $\\frac{4}{11}-\\frac{7}{11}-\\frac{2}{11}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "421",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "求下列各式的值：",
        "1) $62.3+[50.1-3.3\\cdot(96.96:9.6)]\\cdot1.8$；",
        "2) $51.6+[70.2-4.4\\cdot(73.73:7.3)]\\cdot1.6$；",
        "3) $150.88:(3.2\\cdot2.3)-60.27:(4.1\\cdot1.4)$；",
        "4) $592.92:(2.7\\cdot7.2)-102.48:(6.1\\cdot1.6)$."
      ]
    },
    {
